Test-support posture:
- DurableDataProtectionTestServices is test-only and internal to the portal test
  assembly. It holds synthetic key elements in memory only; it writes to no
  disk, registry, environment variable, cloud service, or other external system;
  it contains no secret and no taxpayer value; and no production code can reach
